rved) \n  \n This fixes both Android and iOS since the emitter is shared. \n  \n ### Fix 2 secondary — Auto-expire toast (`RootScene.kt`) \n  \n **File:** `/Users/pablofernandez/Work/hl/app/android/app/src/main/java/com/highlighter/app/ui/RootScene.kt` \n  \n Added `import kotlinx.coroutines.delay`. Inside the `state.toast?.let { toast -> ... }` block (lines 169-186), added a `LaunchedEffect(toast)` keyed on the toast object that `delay(4_000)`s then dispatches `HighlighterAppAction.ClearToast`. Each new distinct toast resets the timer. \n  \n ### Verification results \n  \n - `compileDebugKotlin`: **BUILD SUCCESSFUL** — zero errors, zero warnings \n - `cargo check`: **Finished `dev` profile** — zero errors; pre-existing NMP dependency warnings unchanged (not introduced by this change) \n  \n **Note:** The next APK build will require a full Rust rebuild because `app/core/src/nmp_app.rs` was modified.
